{
  "id": "psychic-formless-adept",
  "name": "Formless Adept",
  "classId": "psychic",
  "summary": "Formless adepts master their psychic powers to unshackle themselves from the confines of the flesh and empower their spellcasting.",
  "replacesText": "Phrenic Pool; Psychic Discipline; Discipline Powers; 1st and 15th-level Phrenic Amplification; Discipline Spells; Remade Self",
  "mechanicalCoverage": "full",
  "mechanicalNotes": [
    "Charisma calculates the phrenic pool; all three body forms have independent Charisma-scaled increment pools, level-based duration and action upgrades, and mutually exclusive tracked effects. Bonus spells appear only while a form is active. Formless Spell, Psychic Possession, and Formless Master defenses are tracked actions."
  ],
